# Build-context ignore file for .devops/rdna-rocm.Dockerfile.
#
# The container build context is the patched llama.cpp source tree, and
# podman/docker only reads `.dockerignore` from the CONTEXT directory -- so
# scripts/build-containers.sh copies this file to `<src>/.dockerignore` before
# building (this repo's root is not the context).  Keep only paths that are not
# part of the canonical source tree or that are build output; excluding a
# tracked source file would make the built tree differ from release.json.
.git
build/
build-*/
*.gguf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
